File:Takada Joyato.jpg|Takada Permanent Night Lantern standing on the embankment of Ashimori River (Nudagawa, Kita Ward, Okayama City)<br />Inscribed with the names of the three shrines: Kibitsu, Yuga, and Konpira
File:Hayashima matsuo konpira-doro.JPG|Matsuosaka Lantern (Hayashima Town)<br />The lantern bears the inscriptions “Konpira Daigongen” and “Kibitsu Shrine”
File:Hayasima kominkan konpira sirube.JPG|Relocated road marker remains at the Hayashima Central Community Center (Hayashima Town)
File:Chayamachi konpira orai sign.jpg|Konpira Orai road marker (Chayamachi, Kurashiki City)<br />Inscribed “sugu furunhira dō”
File:Shimotui Port and Shimotui Seto Bridge.JPG|Shimotsui Port (Kurashiki City)<br />From here, by sea, one heads toward Marugame Port’s Taisuke lantern
