File:Chayamachi Konpira-Daigongen.jpg|In the Chayamachi area of {{ill|Kurashiki|ja|倉敷市}}, the {{ill|Konpira Daigongen|ja|金毘羅大権現 (倉敷市)|lt=Konpira Daigongen|lt_ja=金毘羅大権現}} is situated along the adjacent road—which is part of the Konpira Orai.
File:Bronze statue of Sasaki Morituna on Morituna Bridge.jpg|Morituna Bridge (Fujito)
