File:Takada Joyato.jpg|Takada Permanent Night Lantern standing on the embankment of Ashimori River (Nudagawa, Kita Ward, Okayama City)<br />Inscribed with the names of the three shrines: Kibitsu, Yuga, and Konpira
File:Hayashima matsuo konpira-doro.JPG|Matsuosaka Lantern (Hayashima Town)<br />The lantern bears the inscriptions “Konpira Daigongen” and “Kibitsu Shrine”
